{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:12:50.466430+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "Thank you for the consideration. We expect a fund of your caliber to have a strong in-house team; that is the precise profile of the partners we work with most effectively. Our value is not in replacement, but in providing discreet, on-demand augmentation.\n\nWith that in mind, does your deal flow ever create a temporary analyst backlog, causing promising but lower-priority opportunities to be deferred?\n\nWe offer supplemental research capacity designed for that exact overflow. This ensures your core team can maintain focus on top-tier deals, while no potential outlier is missed due to bandwidth constraints.\n\nIf this challenge resonates, I can arrange a brief call to discuss our analytical framework and process."}
