{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:13:06.735376+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "We appreciate that and typically partner with funds that have a strong in-house team. The goal is never replacement, but augmentation during periods of high deal flow.\n\nThis leads to our core hypothesis: do you ever find that a temporary analyst backlog delays action on promising, but not top-tier, opportunities?\n\nThis is the exact gap we fill. We provide supplemental research and overflow capacity, ensuring you never miss a potential outlier due to bandwidth constraints. Our analysis is rooted in a proprietary 6-Pillar Due Diligence framework, covering aspects from core tech to tokenomics.\n\nAs the subject matter expert, I can provide substantive technical detail on this framework if it's helpful."}
