{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:15:12.072158+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 841, "candidates_tokens": 221, "total_tokens": 3575, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:15:12.072548+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "These are excellent and specific questions. Our process is designed to ensure auditable quality.\n\n1.  **Productivity:** We measure the % lift in your fund's total deal throughput, not a direct team-vs-team delta. The baseline is your historical rate of processed opportunities.\n\n2.  **Version Control:** All research is version-controlled via Git. Drafts on feature branches undergo a mandatory peer review via pull request, with a final quality gate review by a senior analyst before delivery.\n\n3.  **Data Pipeline:** We ingest and normalize multi-source signals (on-chain, APIs). Latency from signal ingestion to a first-pass report in an analyst's queue is typically under 60 minutes.\n\n4.  **PoC Validation:** We isolate speed (reduction in time-on-backlog) and quality (forward performance tracking of our filtered-out vs. recommended deals) as separate KPIs.\n\nThe ultimate goal is relieving analyst backlog, deferred due to bandwidth. Given this, which deferred opportunities consume the most review time once prioritized?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:15:31.326796+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 850, "candidates_tokens": 280, "total_tokens": 2759, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:15:31.327226+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "These are excellent and specific questions.\n\n1.  **Productivity:** We don\u2019t compare analysts head-to-head. Our metric is your backlog reduction rate. We baseline your current queue of deferred deals and measure our throughput against it, quantifying our output in standardized first-pass reports per week.\n\n2.  **Version Control:** Our 6-Pillar DD Framework is rigorously version-controlled. Each startup analysis is a discrete repo. Analysts submit findings via pull requests, which require mandatory review and approval from a senior analyst before merging. A final QA checklist gate ensures quality before delivery.\n\n3.  **Pipeline:** Signals are ingested via API and proprietary scrapers into a central data lake. A normalization layer tags and categorizes data, which is then routed to a work queue for analyst assignment. Latency from signal ingestion to a first-pass report is typically 48-72 hours.\n\n4.  **PoC Validation:** We measure speed by throughput (e.g., 5 deferred deals cleared). We measure quality by the \"pass-through rate\"\u2014the percentage of our reports your team deems worthy of a second-look. This isolates our value.\n\nOur process is designed to ensure this technical framework provides a verifiable impact. The ultimate goal is relieving analyst backlog. How many promising opportunities are typically deferred due to bandwidth in a given quarter?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:15:55.958015+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 843, "candidates_tokens": 246, "total_tokens": 3422, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:15:55.958446+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "These are excellent and specific questions. Our process is designed to ensure verifiable, consistent output.\n\n1.  **Productivity Metrics**: We don't benchmark against client teams. We use an internal baseline, measuring reports-per-analyst against standardized project complexity tiers to guarantee predictable velocity.\n\n2.  **Version Control**: All research is version-controlled in a Git-based repository. The workflow requires peer review for data validation and a senior analyst gate for analytical rigor before final output.\n\n3.  **Data Pipeline**: Signals are ingested from APIs and on-chain indexers into a proprietary normalization schema. A rules-based engine routes tasks to analysts. Latency from signal to first-pass report is under 24 hours.\n\n4.  **PoC Validation**: We isolate speed and quality. Speed is the reduction in your team's \"time-to-disposition\" for an asset. Quality is scored via a post-engagement rubric on accuracy and clarity, targeting zero revision requests.\n\nThe ultimate goal is relieving analyst backlog, deferred due to bandwidth, with a transparent and reliable process.\n\nDoes this framework align with the level of operational rigor you require for a supplemental research partner?"}
