{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:16:50.102634+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "CONSENSUS_RESULT", "winning_proposal_id": 1, "winning_proposal_text": "These are excellent and specific questions. Our process is designed to ensure auditable quality.\n\n1.  **Productivity:** We measure the % lift in your fund's total deal throughput, not a direct team-vs-team delta. The baseline is your historical rate of processed opportunities.\n\n2.  **Version Control:** All research is version-controlled via Git. Drafts on feature branches undergo a mandatory peer review via pull request, with a final quality gate review by a senior analyst before delivery.\n\n3.  **Data Pipeline:** We ingest and normalize multi-source signals (on-chain, APIs). Latency from signal ingestion to a first-pass report in an analyst's queue is typically under 60 minutes.\n\n4.  **PoC Validation:** We isolate speed (reduction in time-on-backlog) and quality (forward performance tracking of our filtered-out vs. recommended deals) as separate KPIs.\n\nThe ultimate goal is relieving analyst backlog, deferred due to bandwidth. Given this, which deferred opportunities consume the most review time once prioritized?", "gemini_calls_swarm": 6}
