{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:17:40.790601+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "Thank you for the directness. Our hypothesis is precise.\n\nThe operational friction we believe your team is facing is not a general backlog, but a strategic deal screening bottleneck. We observe that strong teams like yours must, by necessity, focus on top-tier deals. This can lead to the deferral of high-potential but non-obvious opportunities, creating a hidden opportunity cost.\n\nYou mentioned a \"structured risk-reversal proof engagement.\" We agree. That is the ideal, data-driven method to test this hypothesis on your actual deal flow and quantify the value of capturing those specific, deferred assets."}
